Z||000003||ChadMan||02-19-2000||11:11 AM||||Hey Bastard (I always wanted to say that without offending anyone! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">), if that 944 is not a Turbo, I guarantee you will whoop him good.<P>My buddy Joe has an '84 944 - it looks good, handles well and stops on a dime, but my 86 SE 4-sp was much quicker.  It might be a closer race if your Fiero's an automatic but I still think you'd win.<P>The only place he'll beat you is in top speed.  Joe's 944 will do an indicated 133 mph (though it seemed like it took about five minutes to reach top speed!).||||reg||1
