Z||000010||Spyder||02-19-2000||03:23 PM||||Go For It!!<BR>At least it would be fun.<BR>Since you know when you are going to race.<BR>Make sure you have very little fuel (2 gallons) and add some octane booster.<BR>Make sure you take out anything extra in your car (that extra set of dumbbells).<BR>If you want, take out the spare tire and jack.<BR>Make sure you have a clean air filter.<BR>Hey, no such thing as a fair fight.<BR>Also, great bragging rights for you. I beat a Porsche.||||reg||1
